***requirements***
- [id:TASK-ADD] A user must be able to add a task.
- [id:TASK-ARCHIVE] A user must be able to archive a completed task.

***acceptance tests***
- [covers:TASK-ADD] Given a valid task, when the user adds it, then it appears in the task list.
- [covers:TASK-ARCHIVE] Given a completed task, when the user archives it, then it leaves the active task list.
